```Device Hitting Blocked Domains a Lot | MITRE T1071.004 | hourly, last 60 min```
index=dns sourcetype=pihole ("query[" OR "gravity blocked")
| reverse
| rex "query\[[^\]]+\]\s+(?<domain>\S+)\s+from\s+(?<device>\S+)"
| rex "gravity blocked\s+(?<blocked>\S+)"
| eval domain=coalesce(domain, blocked)
| streamstats last(device) as device by domain
| where isnotnull(blocked)
| stats count as blocked_lookups dc(domain) as domains by device
| where blocked_lookups >= 50
